<title>JAPAN: Advantest up on hopes of microchip market recovery.</title>
<headline>Advantest up on hopes of microchip market recovery.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Advantest Corp shares advanced on Friday morning as investors hoped the business of the maker of semiconductor testing devices would flourish along with the recovery in the chip market, brokers said.</p>
<p>At 0050 GMT, the shares were 90 yen higher at 4,700 yen.</p>
</text>
